{"screen_name": "marin_anchor", "file": "marin_anchor-963e58", "name": "海鈴/マリン⚓️", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1803588221387116544/uDgZDwqr.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1136182980542488576/1747136287/1500x500", "description": "絵はXfolioにまとめています。ﾌﾞﾙｽｶ→⚓️marin-anchor  ご依頼は固ツイより。たまに動く→@Marin_anchor", "total_works": 17, "scraped_works": 17, "first_seen": "2026-02-23T14:26:25.218553+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-02-26T21:23:27.635961+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 3000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-23T14:26:25.218553+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 3000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 3000, "max": 3000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/marin_sousaku", "name": "marin_sousaku"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "https://xfolio.jp/portfolio/Marin_anchor", "name": ""}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": true, "works": [{"path": "/@marin_anchor/works/17", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/548dbb7f/uploads/origins/04a8bba3-aec5-4729-875c-3cd5ce364755?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c2d41c31a7ecb700f88eb64eddaf63bb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/548dbb7f/uploads/origins/04a8bba3-aec5-4729-875c-3cd5ce364755?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c2d41c31a7ecb700f88eb64eddaf63bb, https://si.imgix.net/548dbb7f/uploads/origins/04a8bba3-aec5-4729-875c-3cd5ce364755?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1f76cc9de93be1056b62a663312f08f5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/548dbb7f/uploads/origins/04a8bba3-aec5-4729-875c-3cd5ce364755?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8ced8738abeb4b3314a131a44e6ffc44 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして\n\n先日skeb募集中のタグにて貴方の可愛らしいイラストを拝見し､是非とも拙宅の子も描いて頂きたくリクエストを送らせていただきました｡\n\n〇依頼内容\n下記のリンクの[エンヴィー]をお願いいたします\n\nhttps://x.com/majima_san4/status/1944701882913726716?s=46&t=5ggQqV_ECII6TATabP2B7A\n\nイタズラ好きな小悪魔(中身は男)です\n\n構図やポーズ等は全てお任せします\n\n金額等不足がありましたら､再送請求又はキャンセルをお願いいたします｡\n\nお忙しいところ恐縮ですが､ご検討の程よろしくお願いします｡", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@marin_anchor/works/16", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c87cf013/uploads/origins/829f2669-c5f6-46fd-a3ff-7cc03bf23092?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=341e95c127848ee89acea63066cabd0a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c87cf013/uploads/origins/829f2669-c5f6-46fd-a3ff-7cc03bf23092?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=341e95c127848ee89acea63066cabd0a, https://si.imgix.net/c87cf013/uploads/origins/829f2669-c5f6-46fd-a3ff-7cc03bf23092?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1b7ca3c3b3d3c7fe87156544e7850ed4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c87cf013/uploads/origins/829f2669-c5f6-46fd-a3ff-7cc03bf23092?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0cdc54ff931563592d1a5b54d37f1903 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！  あなたの作品が本当に大好きです！  私のキャラクターを描いていただけませんか？  彼女はパンケキという名前の饅頭タコです。  ちょっとグレムリンでトラブルメーカーです。  ポーズや表情はお任せします！ありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/20712261.pankeki", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@marin_anchor/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e7cda822/uploads/origins/1d17eb12-b1d8-42af-b323-79f54f294bd9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=149b9c697d27c2a1a52c032ff7f59b9d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e7cda822/uploads/origins/1d17eb12-b1d8-42af-b323-79f54f294bd9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=149b9c697d27c2a1a52c032ff7f59b9d, https://si.imgix.net/e7cda822/uploads/origins/1d17eb12-b1d8-42af-b323-79f54f294bd9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8a19e8bd5f0e15bf1553ec5f155dadce 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e7cda822/uploads/origins/1d17eb12-b1d8-42af-b323-79f54f294bd9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5495f6e5e9a29575105c3d7c91abb781 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Can you draw my character in your style?\n\nPlease give her a confident/happy expression.\n\nPose and outfit are up to you.\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/4eaynhX", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@marin_anchor/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2b54d25f/uploads/origins/35616991-4b3c-41d6-a7e5-22abe2a469f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=82ea18a050af8237056499ba6d8bcb89", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2b54d25f/uploads/origins/35616991-4b3c-41d6-a7e5-22abe2a469f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=82ea18a050af8237056499ba6d8bcb89, https://si.imgix.net/2b54d25f/uploads/origins/35616991-4b3c-41d6-a7e5-22abe2a469f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=49fcb8c004bef5c4279de23db65b5783 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2b54d25f/uploads/origins/35616991-4b3c-41d6-a7e5-22abe2a469f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0812e92755515eaec45f25e91a5b585b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I would like an image with my aquatic dragongirl Laharika https://imgur.com/qxeKxBz\n\nShe is wearing her witch attire https://imgur.com/a/dPJcnFk\nIf possible include the baby dragon. Laharika made the dragon out of water using magic. Laharika loves her dragon and treats it like a pet.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@marin_anchor/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5945ff5c/uploads/origins/31ac86ff-1566-4867-8f02-66a7caf078f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f6e9bccc51aeaa22b392e91fa474fe76", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5945ff5c/uploads/origins/31ac86ff-1566-4867-8f02-66a7caf078f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f6e9bccc51aeaa22b392e91fa474fe76, https://si.imgix.net/5945ff5c/uploads/origins/31ac86ff-1566-4867-8f02-66a7caf078f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f2085cb6656b044d0f20fdee1d24e956 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5945ff5c/uploads/origins/31ac86ff-1566-4867-8f02-66a7caf078f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1895f58b8fb87c650378de2d03d7ae50 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I would like to see my dragongirl Sienna https://imgur.com/a/Irnb1zj \nSienna wears her witch outfit https://imgur.com/a/5Oxw6Ol", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@marin_anchor/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/23ccb891/uploads/origins/b9774e98-57d7-43c9-b7f3-5388cd44d745?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5ea4e4ce93bfd4a10d0cf67ec1a21955", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/23ccb891/uploads/origins/b9774e98-57d7-43c9-b7f3-5388cd44d745?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5ea4e4ce93bfd4a10d0cf67ec1a21955, https://si.imgix.net/23ccb891/uploads/origins/b9774e98-57d7-43c9-b7f3-5388cd44d745?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ec7004e48e89dfff74da356e88bae330 2x, https://si.imgix.net/23ccb891/uploads/origins/b9774e98-57d7-43c9-b7f3-5388cd44d745?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a50f3472a6c055542d178acc312a9bd8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you, ⚓️.\nI would like you to draw my favorite character, Aoi from Princess Connect.\nThe composition, costume, etc. are up to you.\nFor your information, this girl is cute when she blushes.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@marin_anchor/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1a08d88b/uploads/origins/0524930c-3c6f-4ffb-b4ba-d3b8f9c023df?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc4d9d6f36b9426fc521be135cc1293e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1a08d88b/uploads/origins/0524930c-3c6f-4ffb-b4ba-d3b8f9c023df?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc4d9d6f36b9426fc521be135cc1293e, https://si.imgix.net/1a08d88b/uploads/origins/0524930c-3c6f-4ffb-b4ba-d3b8f9c023df?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=67fe4bb750b41a9dc58cdb04e2213d82 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1a08d88b/uploads/origins/0524930c-3c6f-4ffb-b4ba-d3b8f9c023df?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eca156acc7a22d782e19592711836637 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello <3\nI love your artstyle! \nI'm a german mermaid-VTuber and I'd like to request my VTuber Character in a attack pose. \nShe has a very positive / hyperactive / cheeky personality and loves anything with tentacles, fish and art. \n\nPlease add commercial use!\nThank you so much for considering my request!\nMaakurika\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/19xONBK329iNS5CpsAME1jbQmcj3jlmJd?usp=share_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@marin_anchor/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/45fae3d8/uploads/origins/a25f3fd0-c031-40c5-bf38-dfa2ee55a6d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=659b987bc254ce2211ea9beb2ca304fd", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/45fae3d8/uploads/origins/a25f3fd0-c031-40c5-bf38-dfa2ee55a6d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=659b987bc254ce2211ea9beb2ca304fd, https://si.imgix.net/45fae3d8/uploads/origins/a25f3fd0-c031-40c5-bf38-dfa2ee55a6d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9a019cc4506ceffdb9ee0841a01c4356 2x, https://si.imgix.net/45fae3d8/uploads/origins/a25f3fd0-c031-40c5-bf38-dfa2ee55a6d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e193c75b32ccdec1f9ba8ed05aa40c4a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@marin_anchor/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b79daf8c/uploads/origins/1cb6fd13-8957-4549-9792-950f4225c36c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fbd0a4694124d754a7660b6abb244e89", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b79daf8c/uploads/origins/1cb6fd13-8957-4549-9792-950f4225c36c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fbd0a4694124d754a7660b6abb244e89, https://si.imgix.net/b79daf8c/uploads/origins/1cb6fd13-8957-4549-9792-950f4225c36c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=447f179d5206f96257b9e0ef8f9b2354 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b79daf8c/uploads/origins/1cb6fd13-8957-4549-9792-950f4225c36c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=906117338521e9e6c7e441b8c1d66ad0 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I would like if you could draw my OC/Vtuber! His name is Beryl, a demon intern at a company. He's constantly overworked and tired due to his bosses demands and working overtime. He has tired eyes, sharp teeth, and long, messy hair resulting in people thinking he's a female, but he is in fact a male. He wears his lab coat over his pajamas, and sometimes carries around a sleep mask and pillow so he can take naps during his break time.\n\nPlease draw him however you'd like, in any pose or expression that you see fit!\n\nIf possible, I'd like if I could use the illustration for SNS/distribution, so I'd like a version with a transparent background or PSD with the layers separated. Thank you for considering me!!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/1/folders/1izwuwpKT-mNWOCTAqINqWd_1i62E9k_z", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@marin_anchor/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/db1b0c0d/uploads/origins/941dd514-1c17-46d6-89f7-449e9f7002c8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6eca9ace1b5e3fad74bb2f930b5ce5cb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/db1b0c0d/uploads/origins/941dd514-1c17-46d6-89f7-449e9f7002c8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6eca9ace1b5e3fad74bb2f930b5ce5cb, https://si.imgix.net/db1b0c0d/uploads/origins/941dd514-1c17-46d6-89f7-449e9f7002c8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6afc8bf41e3321399870bdc14f632ec5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/db1b0c0d/uploads/origins/941dd514-1c17-46d6-89f7-449e9f7002c8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1ff965e419fa28700f58893b10a0c97f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "いつもTwitterでお世話になってます！かねなしです！\nSkeb宣伝してるツイート見て今だ！と思って爆速で資料描きました！\n\n【要望】\n自創作のロネリを描いてもらいたいです。\n構図や表情等は全てお任せしますが、かっこいい雰囲気で描いてもらえたら嬉しいです。血とかあっても大丈夫ですむしろ大歓迎です！\n詳細は資料を見てもらえたら！分からないところは想像で大丈夫です。\n\n【使用用途】\nTwitterのアイコンや、個人観賞にしたいと考えてます。\n\n是非ともご検討宜しくお願い致します！そして体調等気を付けて、これからの活動も一人のフォロワーとして楽しみにしてます！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1EFXjyr4Ful1vD1H0-rqNA3J9AitDzX-j?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@marin_anchor/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0700a2b3/uploads/origins/33c7d6a0-4400-46d1-ac7c-70220370c58e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7c1f44c682b40900a4dff99d42218076", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0700a2b3/uploads/origins/33c7d6a0-4400-46d1-ac7c-70220370c58e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7c1f44c682b40900a4dff99d42218076, https://si.imgix.net/0700a2b3/uploads/origins/33c7d6a0-4400-46d1-ac7c-70220370c58e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ddabb3e51804efad4c3db127467dabee 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0700a2b3/uploads/origins/33c7d6a0-4400-46d1-ac7c-70220370c58e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3a46874823a9cd6c77e8438f8f452d0e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I love Marin's drawings so much that I made this request!\nI would like to see our self-seeker, Sachi Kamigata, in Marin's drawing!\nI don't care what the situation is as long as you draw it for me! I'd like to see her eating something, since she's such a gourmand character!\n\nPlease refer to this URL!\nhttps://twitter.com/TRPG_Matsumatsu/status/1571551269466275840 (first picture)\nhttps://twitter.com/TRPG_Matsumatsu/status/1493637876222885888\n\nWhenever you have time is fine, and if you're busy, just ignore me! Best regards!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@marin_anchor/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/58b98909/uploads/origins/b91d7d80-4a2f-492d-bd90-1c4c157cc975?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a629a70dd385e006663f0906c4305fb8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/58b98909/uploads/origins/b91d7d80-4a2f-492d-bd90-1c4c157cc975?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a629a70dd385e006663f0906c4305fb8, https://si.imgix.net/58b98909/uploads/origins/b91d7d80-4a2f-492d-bd90-1c4c157cc975?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=79be7d0eed5d1b4a95c8d8c1d5a27db0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/58b98909/uploads/origins/b91d7d80-4a2f-492d-bd90-1c4c157cc975?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a804926ac30948a62f2b6b396f8e19d8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi! I really enjoyed your illustrations!\n\nIs it possible for you to draw my character? She is a demon who loves sweets and the moon!\nMaybe you could draw a Hallo